    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Historic Sanborn Fire Insurance Maps from 1916 show Portia’s downtown footprint, labeled businesses, and industrial buildings.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7,
        8,
        11
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://hometownhistorymaps.com/pages/history-of-portia-arkansas"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Only one Sanborn map of Portia exists, dated 1916, making it a rare visual record of the town’s early 20th‑century layout.",
