        4,
        11
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://hometownhistorymaps.com/pages/history-of-portia-arkansas"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "US 63 and US 412 run concurrently through Portia’s center, linking the town to nearby communities.",
